“the Valuation Acts” means the Lands Valuation (Scotland) Act 1854, the Acts amending that Act, and any other enactment relating to valuation;
“year”, except in paragraph 2 of Schedule 4, means the financial year of a local authority;
“year of revaluation” means the year 2023-24 and each third year thereafter.
2 Expressions used in this Act and in the Act of 1973 shall have the same meanings in this Act as in that Act.
